{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Brewbie\u2019s Alchemy Desk!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a forgotten corner of the magical world, ancient potion recipes lie scattered in dusty pages. As a young alchemist, you accidentally summon the Brewbies\u2014playful spirits who know how to brew potions. With their help, you\u2019ll rediscover lost alchemical arts and uncover the secrets of their kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras/9c73f4da0cc5ac0135792aa6bcb8e037.avif?t=1770531594\" width=1560 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with unique potion recipes, upgrade handy magical tools, and make brewing both fun and effortless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras/267693c3b2eb0f3ec538cb7ea642e196.avif?t=1770531594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras_big/267693c3b2eb0f3ec538cb7ea642e196.webp?t=1770531594 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your potion workshop at your own pace\u2014earn gold even while idle, and grow your little desk-sized empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras/26bccc69baffac5cd405ef9fbbff3bb9.avif?t=1770531594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras_big/26bccc69baffac5cd405ef9fbbff3bb9.webp?t=1770531594 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras/c2ab440d73606b0b018bd3c9022dcf6f.avif?t=1770531594\" width=1560 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your helpers: the Brewbies. Drawn to the scent of potions and the aura of your workshop, these cheerful spirits each bring their own talents to support you in every task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras/1267e6278a73eb7c3c558013e4bd67ae.avif?t=1770531594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras_big/1267e6278a73eb7c3c558013e4bd67ae.webp?t=1770531594 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect magical ingredients, useful tools, and charming decorations through expeditions and other adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras/91d389b1b59d0306355a0d3c26cc53e8.avif?t=1770531594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras_big/91d389b1b59d0306355a0d3c26cc53e8.webp?t=1770531594 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras/921b8c5c6c2e5bac04809d42045bbbec.avif?t=1770531594\" width=1560 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your desk with decorations and transform it into a personal sanctuary. Relax with soothing white noise and dynamic weather effects, and switch the atmosphere whenever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras/d3b567d603dc18daad821565de6caaab.avif?t=1770531594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras_big/d3b567d603dc18daad821565de6caaab.webp?t=1770531594 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras/081238f98d36f6815fb217943ba66729.avif?t=1770531594\" width=1560 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set Brewbie\u2019s Alchemy Desk as your desktop wallpaper! Watch potions bubble and Brewbies scurry about at a glance. The workshop runs automatically in the background\u2014perfect for study breaks or while working. With built-in focus tools like a Pomodoro timer and to-do list, it\u2019s both enchanting and practical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras/e660e23017d8ca9e440f203e2715725d.avif?t=1770531594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras_big/e660e23017d8ca9e440f203e2715725d.webp?t=1770531594 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959910?t=1770531594","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959910?t=1770531594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/978e04223f6a3e7cce5e24b501e66f7c3c7ed61d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770531594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/978e04223f6a3e7cce5e24b501e66f7c3c7ed61d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770531594","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Brewbie\u2019s Alchemy Desk!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a forgotten corner of the magical world, ancient potion recipes lie scattered in dusty pages. As a young alchemist, you accidentally summon the Brewbies\u2014playful spirits who know how to brew potions. With their help, you\u2019ll rediscover lost alchemical arts and uncover the secrets of their kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras/9c73f4da0cc5ac0135792aa6bcb8e037.avif?t=1770531594\" width=1560 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with unique potion recipes, upgrade handy magical tools, and make brewing both fun and effortless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras/267693c3b2eb0f3ec538cb7ea642e196.avif?t=1770531594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras_big/267693c3b2eb0f3ec538cb7ea642e196.webp?t=1770531594 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your potion workshop at your own pace\u2014earn gold even while idle, and grow your little desk-sized empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras/26bccc69baffac5cd405ef9fbbff3bb9.avif?t=1770531594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras_big/26bccc69baffac5cd405ef9fbbff3bb9.webp?t=1770531594 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras/c2ab440d73606b0b018bd3c9022dcf6f.avif?t=1770531594\" width=1560 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your helpers: the Brewbies. Drawn to the scent of potions and the aura of your workshop, these cheerful spirits each bring their own talents to support you in every task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span clas