=1560 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set Brewbie\u2019s Alchemy Desk as your desktop wallpaper! Watch potions bubble and Brewbies scurry about at a glance. The workshop runs automatically in the background\u2014perfect for study breaks or while working. With built-in focus tools like a Pomodoro timer and to-do list, it\u2019s both enchanting and practical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras/e660e23017d8ca9e440f203e2715725d.avif?t=1770531594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/extras_big/e660e23017d8ca9e440f203e2715725d.webp?t=1770531594 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p>","developers":["StarStair Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959910/ba79f7c46b5c57d53398c93be5d2a162bd0ec8c6/header.jpg?t=1770531594","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Brewbie\u2019s Alchemy Desk","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-6100 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 670 / Radeon HD 7970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>